      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://headtilt.me/page/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;about-me&#34;&gt;About Me&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m Rob, a Digital Technologies educator who lives in south-west Western Australia.
I love education and learning, and firmly believe you can&amp;rsquo;t be an effective teacher if you&amp;rsquo;re
not also passionate about your own learning. As a result, most of what I share is about things
I am interested in learning about myself, and sometimes their application to teaching.
Educational theory is interesting too, but this site isn&amp;rsquo;t really about that.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
